{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深圳APEC｜特朗普從深圳啟程返回美國\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APEC-LEAVE-261119-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國總統特朗普從深圳啟程回國。</p><p>中俄美三方會談結束後，特朗普晚上乘坐專車抵達深圳寶安機場，外長王毅在場送行，兩人在紅地毯上稍作停留及交談。特朗普之後再和其他在場送機的人士握手寒暄，才登上空軍一號，啟程返回美國馬里蘭州的安德魯斯空軍基地。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.454518+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:10:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:25.117053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:13.648187+00:00","content_hash":"ef94df113ff184b41028a658a6d45d9b6b634fde99dec3a80e092074fb56397e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.454518+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}